<https://github.com/john1hsu/business-knowledge-graph/id/modigliani-miller-theorem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The proposition, introduced by Franco Modigliani and Merton Miller in 1958, that in a frictionless market a firm's value and average cost of capital are independent of its mix of debt and equity, so that any real-world effect of financing choices must come from taxes or other market imperfections." .
